Dataset and Third-Party Model Notice

1. Dataset provenance and rights:
   The TURAS dataset (`turas-tr-econ-legis-v0.1`) is derived from
   `disco-eth/WorldSpeech` (`tr_tr`), which is distributed under
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0).
   Audio recordings and protected transcripts are not redistributed in this
   repository; only selection code, split IDs, hashes, exclusion ledgers, and
   aggregate statistics are committed. Any downstream use of WorldSpeech-derived
   data must comply with CC BY-NC 4.0 attribution and non-commercial terms.

2. Pretrained model checkpoints:
   Upstream pretrained models referenced by configs remain subject to their own
   licenses, including `openai/whisper-small` and `openai/whisper-large-v3`
   (MIT), `mpoyraz/wav2vec2-xls-r-300m-cv7-turkish` (CC BY 4.0, attribution
   required), `mpoyraz/wav2vec2-xls-r-300m-cv8-turkish` (Apache-2.0), and
   `Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-*` (Apache-2.0).
